### E · Worked math

{% sample title="Clip E · Worked math" %}
**Text:** If x is three, then two x plus one is seven, not eight: you double first, then add the one.

**Listen for:** "not eight" said as a correction, and stress on the second "then": double first, then add. In the Markdown version, whether the underscores are read aloud.

**Markdown \_then\_:** `If x is three, then two x plus one is seven, not eight: you double first, _then_ add the one.`

**Direction:** none; every model read it without direction.
{% /sample %}

